@page "/About"

<PageTitle>About — Verdict</PageTitle>

<div class="about-page">

    <div class="about-hero">
        <div class="hero-icon">⚖</div>
        <h1>Verdict</h1>
        <p class="hero-tagline">The community that helps you decide.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>What is Verdict?</h2>
        <p>
            Verdict is a platform for sharing the decisions you can't make alone. Post your dilemma,
            lay out the options, and let the community vote and comment. Whether it's a career pivot,
            a life choice, or something as simple as what to order — real people give you real perspectives.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>How It Works</h2>
        <div class="steps">
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">1</div>
                <div class="step-body">
                    <h3>Post your dilemma</h3>
                    <p>Write your question, add context, set your options and pick a time limit. It takes under a minute.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">2</div>
                <div class="step-body">
                    <h3>The community votes</h3>
                    <p>People browse by category, home feed, or community and cast their vote on your options.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">3</div>
                <div class="step-body">
                    <h3>Read the comments</h3>
                    <p>Votes show you the numbers. Comments show you the reasoning. Both matter.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">4</div>
                <div class="step-body">
                    <h3>Make your decision</h3>
                    <p>Armed with perspectives from people who've been there, decide with confidence.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>Features</h2>
        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🗳️</div>
                <h3>Anonymous voting</h3>
                <p>Post owners see results but not who voted for what.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">💬</div>
                <h3>Threaded comments</h3>
                <p>Nested replies with vote badges so you know where the commenter stands.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🌐</div>
                <h3>Communities</h3>
                <p>Subscribe to categories and custom communities. Your feed, your interests.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">⏱️</div>
                <h3>Time limits</h3>
                <p>Set a deadline from 1 hour to 1 week. Urgency drives engagement.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🔥</div>
                <h3>Smart sorting</h3>
                <p>Browse by New, Hot, Popular, or Top. Find what's trending right now.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">💾</div>
                <h3>Draft saving</h3>
                <p>Not ready to post? Save multiple drafts and come back when you are.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section mission-section">
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <blockquote>
            To give everyone access to a thoughtful second opinion — from people who genuinely care about helping.
        </blockquote>
        <p>
            Big decisions feel smaller when you're not facing them alone. Verdict exists to be that
            trusted crowd in your corner, available any time, for any choice.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>Community Standards</h2>
        <div class="standards-list">
            <div class="standard"><span>✅</span><p>Vote honestly and comment constructively.</p></div>
            <div class="standard"><span>✅</span><p>Respect that every dilemma matters to the person posting it.</p></div>
            <div class="standard"><span>✅</span><p>Report content that violates these values — we review every report.</p></div>
            <div class="standard"><span>❌</span><p>No harassment, hate speech, spam, or deliberate misinformation.</p></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="about-cta">
        <p>Ready to get a verdict?</p>
        <a class="cta-btn" href="/post">Post your dilemma ⚖</a>
    </div>

</div>

<style>
    .about-page {
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 2rem auto;
        padding: 0 1rem 4rem;
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .about-hero {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 3rem 1rem 2.5rem;
    }

    .hero-icon {
        font-size: 3rem;
        line-height: 1;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .about-hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.8rem;
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        color: #052767;
    }

    .hero-tagline {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        color: #666;
        margin: 0;
        font-style: italic;
    }

    /* Sections */
    .about-section {
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .about-section h2 {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        color: #052767;
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #e8ecf7;
    }

    .about-section p {
        font-size: 0.97rem;
        color: #444;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    }

    /* Steps */
    .steps {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .step {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1.1rem;
        align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .step-num {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #052767;
        color: white;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .step-body h3 {
        margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: #222;
    }

    .step-body p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #666;
        line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* Features */
    .features-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .feature-card {
        background: #f7f9ff;
        border: 1px solid #e8ecf7;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .feature-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }

    .feature-card h3 {
        margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #052767;
    }

    .feature-card p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #555;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Mission */
    .mission-section blockquote {
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        border-left: 4px solid #052767;
        background: #f0f4ff;
        border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-style: italic;
        color: #052767;
    }

    /* Standards */
    .standards-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.6rem;
    }

    .standard {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        align-items: flex-start;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: #444;
    }

    .standard span { flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 1px; }
    .standard p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }

    /* CTA */
    .about-cta {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2.5rem 1rem;
        background: #f0f4ff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .about-cta p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: #444;
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
    }

    .cta-btn {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
        background: #052767;
        color: white;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .cta-btn:hover { background: #3a0647; }

    @@media (max-width: 540px) {
        .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .about-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
    }
</style>
